      en: ["Founded in 1890 by the British Baptist Missionary Society (BMS).", "Joseph Conrad visited the mission in 1890 while captaining a river steamer.", "The mission was instrumental in the early codification of the Lingala language.", "Lisala is situated at an elevation of approximately 410 meters (1,345 feet).", "Future president Mobutu Sese Seko was born in Lisala in 1930.", "The station acted as a key refueling point for Upper Congo river traffic."],
