      en: ["Built during the 1920s by Belgian Premonstratensian missionaries.", "The cathedral is dedicated to Saint Thérèse of Lisieux.", "Buta is the episcopal see of the Roman Catholic Diocese of Buta.", "The architectural design is a prime example of Belgian colonial Neo-Romanesque.", "The city of Buta is located on the Rububi River in Bas-Uele province.", "The cathedral acted as a vital sanctuary during the 1964 Simba Rebellion."],
