      en: ["Inongo was founded as a colonial post in 1883.", "The city is situated at an elevation of 317 meters above sea level.", "It has been the capital of Mai-Ndombe Province since 2015.", "Lake Mai-Ndombe covers an area of approximately 2,300 square kilometers.", "The city is a vital hub for inland water transport in western DRC.", "The area was historically central to the rubber extraction industry."],
